# 從頭再嚟

(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue: 從頭再嚟，係指人嘅從頭到尾嘅行動。 (lau4 bing1 hou2 zai2)
eng: To go from head to head, it means to act from start to finish. (lau4 bing1 hou2 zai2)
<eg>
yue: 從頭再嚟，唔好急唔好慢。 (lau4 bing1 hou2 zai2.)
eng: To go from head to head, don't rush or be slow. (lau4 bing1 hou2 zai2.) [end of text]


